# RUN: llc -mtriple=aie2ps --start-before=postmisched -verify-machineinstrs \
# RUN:     -debug-only=sched-blocks -o /dev/null %s 2>&1 \
# RUN:   | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=DBG
# REQUIRES: asserts
#
# Test sibling loop optimization: no merge due to resource conflicts.
#
# Generated from gemm_int8_psum_0.ll with:
#   llc -mtriple=aie2ps -O2 --aie-enable-outer-loop-pipelining -stop-before=postmisched
#
# OLP structure (bb numbers after OLP transformation):
#   bb.0 (OuterPreheader) -> bb.1 (SteadyTop/Prologue) -> bb.2 (SteadyInner)
#   -> bb.3 (SteadyBottom/Epilogue/Latch) -> bb.4 (PeeledIterTop)
#   -> bb.5 (PeeledIterInner) -> bb.6 (PeeledIterBottom)
#
# Slack analysis:
#   The epilogue (bb.3) has 16 bundles, the prologue (bb.1) has 12 bundles.
#   The tightest cross-boundary edge has:
#     Height=1 Depth=6 Lat=4 Slack=3
#   This is a 4-cycle latency dependency between an epilogue JNZD branch
#   at Height=1 and a prologue VSHUFFLE at Depth=6. The slack of 3 limits
#   MaxMerge = min(7 matching, 3 slack, 3 slack) = 3.
#
# Resource analysis:
#   Despite sufficient slack, resource conflicts prevent ALL merge counts:
#   - MergeCount=3 (delta=-2): The 3rd prologue bundle contains a
#     VLDB_3D_dmx_ldb_x writing $x10,$p1 which conflicts with the vector
#     load unit already occupied in the epilogue bundle at position -2.
#   - MergeCount=2 (delta=-1): The same VLDB_3D instruction still conflicts
#     because at 2-bundle overlap the load unit is still occupied.
#   - MergeCount=1 (delta=-1): The 1st prologue bundle contains a
#     VMUL_vmul_vmul_cm_core_X_X writing $dm4 which conflicts with the
#     vector multiply unit busy in the epilogue's last cycle.
#
# Result: No bundles can be merged. The optimizer reports "Resource
# mergeability check failed" and returns 0.
#
# Verify the optimizer finds matching bundles and sufficient slack.
# DBG: optimizeSiblingLoops: Processing outer loop latch
# DBG: Found 7 matching bundles
# DBG: Slack (Epilogue->SteadyPrologue): 3 cycles
# DBG: Slack (Epilogue->LastIterPrologue): 3 cycles
#
# Verify the resource check tries decreasing merge counts.
# DBG: checkResourceMergeability: EpilogueSize=16 SteadyPrologueSize=12 LastPrologueIterSize=12 MaxMerge=3
# DBG: Trying MergeCount=3
# DBG: Conflict (delta=-2):
# DBG: Trying MergeCount=2
# DBG: Conflict (delta=-1):
# DBG: Trying MergeCount=1
# DBG: Conflict (delta=-1):
#
# Verify all merge counts fail.
# DBG: No bundles can be merged without conflicts
--- |
  
